=== STATES (every state renders — no hidden surfaces) ===
  loading ......... pre-snapshot / initial-fetch skeleton (4 tile-shaped skeletons)
  content ......... the four tiles once a snapshot is present (web render)
  empty ........... no vehicles (web `enabled: vehicles.length > 0` → query disabled) →
                    friendly TSEmptyState ("No vehicles" / "Add a vehicle…"), never blank
  error ........... hard fleet-state query failure with no readings → TSQueryError with
                    retry → model.refresh()
  stale ........... freshness window exceeded → amber freshness chip + one guarded
                    auto-refresh (web refetch self-refresh)
  offline ......... no connectivity → cached values + red offline chip
  Each has a #if DEBUG preview and a model/adapter/render test (EXECUTED green).

